{"suttaId":"tha-ap523","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[3467,3505],"vripara":"1"},"segments":{"tha-ap523:0.3":"Tiṇamuṭṭhidāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap523:1.1":"“Himavantassāvidūre, lambako nāma pabbato;","tha-ap523:1.3":"Tattheva tisso [tatthopatisso (sī. pī. ka.)] sambuddho, abbhokāsamhi caṅkami.","tha-ap523:2.1":"“Migaluddo pure āsiṃ, araññe kānane ahaṃ;","tha-ap523:2.3":"Disvāna taṃ devadevaṃ, tiṇamuṭṭhimadāsahaṃ.","tha-ap523:3.1":"“Nisīdanatthaṃ buddhassa, datvā cittaṃ pasādayiṃ;","tha-ap523:3.3":"Sambuddhaṃ abhivādetvā, pakkāmiṃ [pakkamiṃ (ka.)] uttarāmukho.","tha-ap523:4.1":"“Aciraṃ gatamattassa [gatamattaṃ maṃ (sī. syā.)], migarājā apothayi [aheṭhayi (sī. syā. pī.)];","tha-ap523:4.3":"Sīhena pothito [pātito (sī. pī.), ghāṭito (syā.)] santo, tattha kālaṅkato ahaṃ.","tha-ap523:5.1":"“Āsanne me kataṃ kammaṃ, buddhaseṭṭhe anāsave;","tha-ap523:5.3":"Sumutto saravegova, devalokamagacchahaṃ.","tha-ap523:6.1":"“Yūpo tattha subho āsi, puññakammābhinimmito;","tha-ap523:6.3":"Sahassakaṇḍo satabheṇḍu, dhajālu haritāmayo.","tha-ap523:7.1":"“Pabhā niddhāvate tassa, sataraṃsīva uggato;","tha-ap523:7.3":"Ākiṇṇo devakaññāhi, āmodiṃ kāmakāmihaṃ.","tha-ap523:8.1":"“Devalokā cavitvāna, sukkamūlena codito;","tha-ap523:8.3":"Āgantvāna manussattaṃ, pattomhi āsavakkhayaṃ.","tha-ap523:9.1":"“Catunnavutito kappe, nisīdanamadāsahaṃ;","tha-ap523:9.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, tiṇamuṭṭhe idaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap523:10.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ, bhavā sabbe samūhatā;","tha-ap523:10.3":"Nāgova bandhanaṃ chetvā, viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap523:11.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi, mama buddhassa santike;","tha-ap523:11.3":"Tisso vijjā anuppattā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap523:12.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso, vimokkhāpi ca aṭṭhime;","tha-ap523:12.3":"Chaḷabhiññā sacchikatā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap523:13.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā tiṇamuṭṭhidāyako thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap523:14.1":"Tiṇamuṭṭhidāyakattherassāpadānaṃ paṭhamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
